msgid ""
"Lokalize is the localization tool for KDE and other open source software. It "
"is also a general computer-aided translation system (CAT) with which you can "
"translate OpenDocument files (*.odt). Translate-Toolkit is used internally "
"to extract text for translation from .odt to .xliff files and to merge "
"translation back into .odt file."
msgstr ""
"Lokalize ye la ferramienta de llocalización pa KDE y otru software de códigu "
"llibre. Ye tamién un sistema de traducción asistíu per ordenador (CAT) col "
"que pues traducir ficheros OpenDocument (*.odt). Internamente úsase "
"Translate-Toolkit pa estrayer el testu pa la traducción de ficheros "

